{"id":"n88046-1-8","stage":3,"title":"평 · 评","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88046-1-8-1","ko":"너 그 영화 봤어? 사람들이 좋다고 평을 하더라.","zh":"你看过那部电影吗？大家都说很不错呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋다고","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"평을","meaning":"评，评价，评论","explanation":"평：评，评价，评论；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"평","audio":"/audio/217dca5b5e978f0b7869.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88046","senseId":"1","lemma":"평","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하더라.","meaning":"表示说这样那样的话。","explanation":"하다：表示说这样那样的话。；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"217dca5b5e978f0b","term":"평","zh":"评，评价，评论","audio":"/audio/217dca5b5e978f0b7869.mp3","entryId":"88046","definition":"评判好坏、优劣、对错等；或指那样的话。","pronunciation":["평ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示说这样那样的话。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示说这样那样的话。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/88f2bf8a8e8ed470cfb5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88046-1-8-2","ko":"응. 다들 좋다고 그러더라. 나도 보려고.","zh":"嗯，大家都说很好看。我也打算去看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다들","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋다고","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그러더라.","meaning":"那么说","explanation":"그러다：那么说；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"2","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보려고.","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；려고：非敬语地表达打算，或根据语调询问意图。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那么说","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"那样地说。","pronunciation":["그러다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d617b1192f02e00c1b92.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.737,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88046","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":119,"sequenceScore":3.6346,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你看过那部电影吗？大家都说很不错呢。","嗯，大家都说很好看。我也打算去看。","今天有说中部地区会下雨吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你看过那部电影吗？大家都说很不错呢。","嗯，大家都说很好看。我也打算去看。","今天有说中部地区会下雨吗？"],"answer":1}]}
